export anchor SQLTerminalStyle:
    number: 405
    screen: DatabaseConsole
    name: SQL terminal
    idea: The whole console is one terminal session in a tmux style frame, so the schema, the query, the result table and the history are all plain monospace text drawn with pipes and dashes.
    base: dark
    palette:
        bg: #12110f, the page behind the window
        term: #171512, the terminal window and the style sheet
        bar: #2a251f, the status line and the focused list row
        rule: #4a4238, the window border, pane divider and dashed list rules
        ink: #e8e1d2, session output
        dim: #a89f8f, the banner, comments, durations and labels
        prompt: #d4aaff, the prompt arrow
        path: #8fc8ff, the database name in the prompt and sheet subheads
        hi: #f2b45c, the session tab, result header row, focus and primary button
        onHi: #241706, text on hi
        ok: #9ed98b, plus ok lines and the rows count
        bad: #ff948a, x ERROR lines
    type:
        Monospace only, ui-monospace, SF Mono, Cascadia Mono, Menlo,
        Consolas, DejaVu Sans Mono. 14px at 1.5 for the session, 13px below
        600px wide. The sheet title is 18px bold in hi with a hash prefix,
        subheads carry a double hash. The status line is 13px.
    layout:
        One bordered terminal window with a 24px margin. A thin title row
        reads Brightwork Data shell on the left and production-replica
        read-only on the right. The window splits into a wide session pane
        and a 360px side pane with a 1px divider. The session is a single
        pre block. A dim banner, then the prompt production-replica arrow
        with backslash dt listing the five tables as a pipe table with
        5 rows, backslash d tasks listing the six columns with type and key,
        then the query typed over seven continuation prompts, the result
        table with its header row in amber, a green 3 rows ok, Time 38 ms
        and a blinking block cursor. The side pane shows backslash s history
        as three dashed rows of time, plus ok or x ERROR, name and duration,
        the error text on its own red line, a legend sentence, then a boxed
        backslash conninfo with the three status facts. A tmux bar ends the
        window with an amber data session tab, windows psql and history,
        then RO read-only replica, lag 2s and 14 conns. Below 900px the
        panes stack. Wide session lines scroll inside the pane.
    spacing: One text line is the unit. 12px by 16px pane padding, 24px window margin, 12px on phones.
    density: Very high. Everything is text in one scrollback.
    corners: None. Every box is square.
    borders: 1px #4a4238 solid around the window, title row, divider and boxes, dashed between history rows.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        No pictures. Plus for ok, x for ERROR, a greater than sign for the
        focused row and square brackets around button labels.
    focus: A 2px dashed amber outline offset 2px. A focused list row also gets the bar fill and an amber pointer.
    tone: Shell talk in lower case, such as backslash dt, 3 rows, Time 38 ms, lag 2s.
